# Exercise 1 – Evidence Acquisition Using FTK Imager

## Objective
To acquire volatile memory and forensic evidence using AccessData FTK Imager.

## Tool Used
- FTK Imager

## Description
FTK Imager is a forensic imaging and evidence acquisition tool.
It can be used to acquire volatile memory and non-volatile storage
while maintaining the integrity of forensic evidence.

## Procedure
1. Open FTK Imager.
2. Select the Memory Capture option.
3. Specify the destination location.
4. Start the memory acquisition process.
5. Verify that the memory image was successfully created.

## Result
Volatile memory was successfully acquired using FTK Imager.

